<title>HONG KONG: Nority Int'l 1996 net jumps 91 percent.</title>
<headline>Nority Int'l 1996 net jumps 91 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   29.5   vs 15.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0    vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    79.17  vs 41.47</p>
<p>    Turnover		     991.69 vs 724.25</p>
<p>    Company name		 Nority International Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 19-21</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 5</p>
<p>NOTE - Nority International is a sport shoe maker.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is eight H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents) vs 5.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
